  "description": "It's the year 2004, and Baek Soo-Jung (online ID: Strawberry) is a high school senior who has secretly developed a romance with a guy named Heuk Yeom-Ryong (online ID is literally his name that can be read as \"Black Salt Dragon\") in a MMORPG.\n\nAfter Soo-jung presents the college entrance exams, the fated day of their long-awaited meetup arrives! But the real \"Black Salt Dragon\" turns out to be a completely different person than what she imagined...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=733080), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=4495672)\n\n***Note***: *This webtoon has been adapted into a Korean Drama on February 17, 2025.*",
